# Phase L — baseline detection + ablations (dataset v3)

Records: 16812 (BENIGN 12484 / MALICIOUS 4328) · independent sessions: 100

Validation: StratifiedGroupKFold(n_splits=5) grouped by (campaign, run, supi) — no session spans train/test. Positive class = MALICIOUS. Metrics = mean±std over folds.

Load-matched challenge set = test rows with thp_ul_kbps in [300, 1000) kbps (BENIGN 7047 / MALICIOUS 3731) — the band where both classes are dense.


