## Headline: F1 drop from full test -> load-matched challenge

_If volume-only drops hard while behaviour/full stay up, the model is not just reading volume._

| ablation | best model | F1 (full) | F1 (challenge) | AUC (challenge) |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| bytes-only | hist-gbm | 0.985 | 0.989 | 0.999 |
| pps-only | random-forest | 0.952 | 0.962 | 0.996 |
| size-only | random-forest | 0.961 | 0.999 | 1.000 |
| protocol-only | hist-gbm | 0.938 | 0.950 | 0.997 |
| ran-only | hist-gbm | 0.972 | 0.978 | 0.997 |
| ran+upf | hist-gbm | 0.991 | 0.996 | 1.000 |
| behaviour-only | random-forest | 0.987 | 0.999 | 1.000 |
| full | random-forest | 0.992 | 0.997 | 1.000 |

